{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"5cd3264ad9173f98",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Formula.** Be it an incantation, rune, movement, or collection of ingredients, your magic comes from a recipe. Choose the nature of your formula. ==You may cast magic using these formulas. Your formula pool is equal to half of your **Spellcraft [[Die Max]]**.==",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-260,
			"y":-20,
			"width":420,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"35a7e0cf214e8591",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"You have realized that some materials are mroe valuable than others for a reason. ==You may use more valuable ingredients or focuses to cast stronger spells. When you do this, gain 2 die for the spell. Additionally your formula pool is equal to your ****Spellcraft** [[Die Max]]**==",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-740,
			"y":-560,
			"width":420,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"b2445faed43c203e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Through trial and error, you have learned work arounds for certain aspects of your formula. Perhaps it is a simple substitution of movements or materials. Perhaps an abridged incantation. Regardless, ==you can cast spells easier and cheaper==.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":220,
			"y":-580,
			"width":420,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"efa69e2887ab176f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Your formula pool is equal to your **Spellcraft [[Die Max]]**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-260,
			"y":-220,
			"width":420,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0da72ab87c885e79",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Your formula pool is equal to twice your **Spellcraft [[Die Max]]**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-260,
			"y":-500,
			"width":420,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"bfd0ae31a13a2530",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Your formula pool is equal to thrice your **Spellcraft [[Die Max]]**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-260,
			"y":-740,
			"width":420,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"11a3a773f2de7028",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Twin Soul.** You know an incantation to spilt yourself in two. Your two selves act independently of each other, but share a health pool. Each time you take damage, roll a **Fortitude Check** or drop the effect. This may only be  activated once per day due to the strain on the soul. Trying to further will result in the \"Split\" **[Major Metaphysical Harm](Harm)**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-260,
			"y":-1100,
			"width":420,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"43f40f99233a2d10",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Spell Scribe.** You may notate spells for others to use. When you do this, the person with the recipe can utilize it, regardless of their magic type.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-740,
			"y":-1030,
			"width":420,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"7c21b43d1200bdf6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Expanded Knowledge.** Choose one additional type of Magic to wield. Follow all rules applicable to choosing a type of Magic.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":220,
			"y":-1025,
			"width":420,
			"height":90
		}
	],
